  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please add a way to search for avatars by name or author would be really useful, and was a massive part of the wholesome modding community. There are a lot of people who spent hours looking for their ideal avatar but can't find one, I am one of those people, I've spent many hours looking for a quest compatible witch avatar, since I only have a pc one. It would be really useful to have an option to search for an avatar. People could search for a name or author and find the avatar they're looking for, or find one they didn't know existed and might like. There are avatar authors out there that make public avatars, but don't have a world for them, so this would be very useful for people to have access to more avatar options.",
